{
	Name: "TerrariaImageBuilder"
	Author: "DSH"
	Version: "1.2.0"
	Description: "本模组仅负责把图片转换成方块建造（图像 → 方块像素画），推荐搭配 HEROsMod（全亮 / 建造工具）与 Better Zoom（镜头缩放）。 | This mod only converts images into block builds (image -> block pixel art). Recommended companions: HEROsMod (fullbright / build tools) and Better Zoom (camera zoom)."
	Website: "https://github.com/HikeTopZenith/terraria-image-builder/releases/latest"
	MinimumApiVersion: "2026.4"
}
